He was like.

00:01:34.734 --> 00:01:36.133
-Rude.
-Five-year-old.

00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:38.634
[ Laughing ] Yeah.

00:01:38.634 --> 00:01:41.200
[ Laughs ] He was awesome.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.734
He's a legend.

00:01:43.734 --> 00:01:46.334
